# UX

[docs/ux-flows.md](../../docs/ux-flows.md) · [docs/shared-components.md](../../docs/shared-components.md)

- ≤5 tabs: Home, Clients, center +, Directory, Items — no summary tab.
- Inline create: **one** `CustomBottomSheet`, nested local `Navigator`, never stacked sheets/dialogs.
- Materials/labor: segmented control, not dropdown. Cash/transfer only.
- Receive: hide expense fields. Client change: clear invalid craftsman.
- Green incoming / red outgoing movement styling.

Planned widgets only — do not claim `AppButton` / toaster / etc. exist until implemented.
